{"seq":3,"slug":"regime-selection-best-rate-sourcing","title":"协定择优决策与最优税率申报路径——多协定择一、叠加与冲突","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/preference-regime-comparison-duty-model/regime-selection-best-rate-sourcing","wordCount":3034,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"协定择优决策与最优税率申报路径-多协定择一-叠加与冲突\">协定择优决策与最优税率申报路径——多协定择一、叠加与冲突</h1><p>一批在越南组装、从海防港发往汉堡的蓝牙音箱，可能同时撞上三种互斥的税率可能性：按最惠国（MFN）税率缴 4.7% 的从价税；凭《欧盟—越南自由贸易协定》（EVFTA）的原产地声明适用 0%；或者——如果企业还用着旧账套——误以为越南仍在欧盟普惠制（GSP）普通档里，填一张早已失效的 GSP 声明。第三条路不是&quot;更便宜&quot;，而是<strong>申报错误</strong>。择优的第一步不是算哪条路税率低，而是先厘清<strong>这批货到底有资格站上哪几条路</strong>。</p>\n<p>本文处理<strong>申报层面的选择逻辑</strong>：当同一批货同时满足多个优惠制度的资格时，如何建立可比的税率模型、如何在申报时点做对路径、以及当两条规则互相拉扯（累积冲突、退税禁止、附加税叠加）时以什么顺序裁决。SKU 级的资格判定引擎与供应商声明采集属于本 hub 后续章节，可参见 <a href=\"../sku-origin-qualification-engine/\">SKU 原产地资格引擎</a> 与 <a href=\"../supplier-declaration-scale-documentation/\">供应商原产地声明规模化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-叠加的制度与互斥的申报入口\">核心概念：叠加的制度与互斥的申报入口</h2><p>&quot;存在多个优惠制度&quot;和&quot;可以选择多个优惠制度&quot;是两件不同的事。按法律来源，<strong>自主优惠（autonomous preference）</strong> 是进口方单方面给予的让利，如欧盟普惠制、英国 DCTS、美国 AGOA；<strong>协定优惠（conventional preference）</strong> 是互惠协定下的承诺，如 EVFTA、RCEP、CPTPP、USMCA。二者可由同一原产国同时享有——越南在 2023 年之前同时是欧盟 GSP 普通档受益国与 EVFTA 缔约方，这正是&quot;叠加&quot;的典型。</p>\n<p>但在报关单上，一行货通常只能主张<strong>一个</strong>优惠待遇，选择不是&quot;叠加享受更低的那个&quot;而是&quot;选一条路走到底&quot;，原因有三：<strong>申报入口互斥</strong>（一行货一般只附一种原产地证明——EUR.1 移动证书、原产地声明、REX 声明或 USMCA 认证，重复主张属虚假申报）；<strong>资格互斥</strong>（两条路径的 PSR 可能不同，一批货满足 A 协定的区域价值成分却未必满足 B 协定的税则归类改变，故&quot;可选集合&quot;是先资格筛选再谈税率）；<strong>口径不同</strong>（MFN 基线本身可能已被附加税改写，优惠税率是在被改写的基线上再打折还是独立适用须逐案确认）。</p>\n<p>衡量择优是否成功的行业指标是<strong>优惠利用率（preference utilization rate）</strong>——符合条件的进口中被实际主张优惠的比例。欧盟委员会与 OECD 长期跟踪该指标，发现利用率显著低于 100%，缺口来自信息缺失、原产地证明成本、以及对&quot;是否够格&quot;的不确定（可参见 <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/\">EU Taxation and Customs Union</a> 的统计口径）。工程目标因此不是&quot;知道有优惠&quot;，而是<strong>把资格判定与申报路径自动化到不再漏用</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[同一批货] --&gt; B{原产国}&#10;  B --&gt; C[协定优惠&lt;br/&gt;EVFTA / RCEP / CPTPP / USMCA]&#10;  B --&gt; D[自主优惠&lt;br/&gt;GSP / GSP+ / EBA / DCTS / AGOA]&#10;  B --&gt; E[无优惠&lt;br/&gt;MFN 基线]&#10;  C --&gt; F{满足该协定 PSR?}&#10;  D --&gt; G{在受益国名单?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| E&#10;  G --&gt;|否| E&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[可主张: 0% 或 优惠税率]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[可主张: 优惠税率]&#10;  H --&gt; J[择优: 比税率差 - 合规成本]&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  E --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[同一批货] --&gt; B{原产国}\n  B --&gt; C[协定优惠&lt;br/&gt;EVFTA / RCEP / CPTPP / USMCA]\n  B --&gt; D[自主优惠&lt;br/&gt;GSP / GSP+ / EBA / DCTS / AGOA]\n  B --&gt; E[无优惠&lt;br/&gt;MFN 基线]\n  C --&gt; F{满足该协定 PSR?}\n  D --&gt; G{在受益国名单?}\n  F --&gt;|否| E\n  G --&gt;|否| E\n  F --&gt;|是| H[可主张: 0% 或 优惠税率]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[可主张: 优惠税率]\n  H --&gt; J[择优: 比税率差 - 合规成本]\n  I --&gt; J\n  E --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"制度坐标-各优惠制度的资格门槛与累积范围\">制度坐标：各优惠制度的资格门槛与累积范围</h2><p>要比较，先要把制度放到同一张表里。<strong>资格门槛、证明工具、累积范围</strong>这三类差异是决定&quot;能不能用&quot;和&quot;用了值不值&quot;的三把尺子。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>制度</th>\n<th>法律来源</th>\n<th>资格门槛</th>\n<th>主张工具</th>\n<th>累积范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>欧盟 GSP 普通档 / GSP+ / EBA</td>\n<td>自主优惠（欧盟 GSP 条例）</td>\n<td>中低收入以下；连续三年中高收入即毕业（GSP+ 需履约 27 项公约，EBA 限最不发达）</td>\n<td>原产地声明（REX）</td>\n<td>仅限该国材料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国 DCTS</td>\n<td>自主优惠（2023 年 6 月取代英国 GSP）</td>\n<td>分三档，按世界银行收入组与脆弱性</td>\n<td>原产地声明</td>\n<td>仅限该国材料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EVFTA</td>\n<td>协定优惠</td>\n<td>满足 PSR + 直运规则</td>\n<td>原产地声明</td>\n<td>双边累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PEM 公约</td>\n<td>协定优惠（泛欧地中海）</td>\n<td>满足 PEM PSR</td>\n<td>EUR.1 / 原产地声明</td>\n<td>对角累积 + 全面累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RCEP</td>\n<td>协定优惠</td>\n<td>满足 RCEP PSR</td>\n<td>原产地证明（多种）</td>\n<td>全体缔约方累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPTPP</td>\n<td>协定优惠</td>\n<td>满足 CPTPP PSR</td>\n<td>认证 / 声明</td>\n<td>全体缔约方累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USMCA</td>\n<td>协定优惠</td>\n<td>满足 PSR + 认证</td>\n<td>认证（进口商/出口商/生产商）</td>\n<td>三边累积</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个必须记住的门槛变化：<strong>越南自 2023 年 1 月 1 日起从欧盟 GSP 普通档毕业</strong>（连续三年被世界银行列为中高收入经济体），此后 EVFTA 成为进入欧盟市场的唯一优惠通道；<strong>英国于 2023 年 6 月以 DCTS 取代原 GSP</strong>，档位重新划分。制度坐标会漂移，账套里的默认路径需要定期重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"择优的计算模型-把税率差折算成可比的到手成本\">择优的计算模型：把税率差折算成可比的到手成本</h2><p>税率差不是省下的钱。真正的择优目标函数是<strong>税后到手成本</strong>，它要扣掉三样东西：证明原产地的成本、因优惠而丧失的其他利益、以及附加税的叠加效应。设某申报行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的完税价格为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，制度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 下适用税率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i^{(r)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>lines</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>MFN</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>Benefit</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_r=\\sum_{i\\in \\text{lines}} v_i \\cdot t_i^{(r)}, \\qquad \\Delta_r = D_{\\text{MFN}} - D_r - C_r - \\Delta\\text{Benefit}_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lines</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3217em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MFN</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Benefit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是原产地合规成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>Benefit</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\text{Benefit}_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Benefit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是因选它而放弃的利益（最典型的是<strong>退税 drawback</strong>）。择优因此是带约束的最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>r</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^{*}=\\arg\\max_r \\Delta_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，约束为 PSR、直运、额度三项同时成立。</p>\n<p>税率为零不等于一定选它。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_r \\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<strong>放弃优惠、按 MFN 申报反而是最优解</strong>——这正是&quot;优惠利用率缺口&quot;里被误解的那部分：有些未主张的优惠是理性选择，而非遗漏。以 10 万元完税价、MFN 税率 5%、优惠税率 0% 为例，理论节省 5000 元，但若维护该 SKU 原产地证据链（供应商声明、物料清单归集、PSR 比对）的年度分摊成本为 6000 元，单独看就不应主张。工程做法是<strong>按&quot;原产地证书粒度&quot;而非单行做盈亏平衡</strong>——一张证书覆盖多个 SKU 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被摊薄，结论可能反转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"择优决策算法与申报路径\">择优决策算法与申报路径</h2><p>把上面的约束写成流程就是一套申报路径选择器，关键设计是<strong>先资格筛选、再成本比较、最后落到申报时点</strong>——顺序颠倒会把不可用的制度算进候选集。候选集需通过四道并行门槛：PSR 满足、直运规则满足、配额额度可用、受益国名单有效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function pickRegime(line, regimes) {&#10;  const cand = regimes.filter(&#10;    (r) =&gt;&#10;      // 四道门槛并行筛选&#10;      r.originQualified(line) &amp;&amp; r.directTransportOk(line) &amp;&amp; r.quotaAvailable(line) &amp;&amp; r.beneficiaryActive(line),&#10;  );&#10;  const mfn = duty(line, &#39;MFN&#39;);&#10;  return cand&#10;    .map((r) =&gt; mfn - duty(line, r) - r.complianceCost(line) - r.forgoneBenefit(line))&#10;    .filter((s) =&gt; s &gt; 0)&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; b - a)[0]; // 净收益最大，否则 MFN&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pickRegime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">regimes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> regimes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 四道门槛并行筛选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">originQualified</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">directTransportOk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">quotaAvailable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beneficiaryActive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mfn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> duty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MFN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mfn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> duty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line, r) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">complianceCost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forgoneBenefit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 净收益最大，否则 MFN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>路径落地的最后一步是<strong>申报时点</strong>：优惠可在进口报关时主张（申报单填优惠代码并附证明），也可事后补主张——只要证据链完整，漏填仍有补救窗口（时间窗口见下节）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突与叠加-当两条规则指向同一批货\">冲突与叠加：当两条规则指向同一批货</h2><p>多协定环境下最棘手的是<strong>规则冲突</strong>——两条路各自成立，但合在一起时互相抵消。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突类型</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n<th>裁决要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>累积规则冲突</td>\n<td>A 协定的累积不允许用 B 协定成员的材料</td>\n<td>按最宽松的累积范围重算 PSR，只在单一路径内成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对角 vs 全面累积</td>\n<td>PEM 下&quot;双边&quot;与&quot;全面&quot;累积对同一物料给不同结论</td>\n<td>全面累积承认区内在制品，双边不承认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退税禁止</td>\n<td>USMCA 取消成员间符合原产地货物的关税退还</td>\n<td>优惠与退税不可兼得，须比&quot;优惠税额&quot;与&quot;可退税额&quot;孰大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附加税叠加</td>\n<td>优惠税率与 Section 232/301、反倾销叠加</td>\n<td>附加税通常独立于优惠基数，须在建模范式里单列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加工贸易冲突</td>\n<td>保税/进料加工料件已享免税，再主张 FTA 优惠</td>\n<td>双重优惠禁止，按料件来源逐层追溯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>退税禁止</strong>是最容易被漏算的一项：USMCA 取消了对成员间符合原产地规则货物的关税退还机制（除历史过渡安排外），进口商不能既享受零关税优惠、又对用于生产的进口料件申请退税——两条路的收益必须二选一后再比较。相比之下，多数欧盟工业品 FTA 仍允许在满足&quot;替代退税&quot;限制的前提下保留退税，两种制度的净收益口径并不通用，不能套用同一套成本模型。</p>\n<p><strong>累积范围</strong>决定&quot;同一批物料能算作谁的材料&quot;。RCEP 允许在全部缔约方范围内累积原产材料：一个中国产零部件、在越南组装、出口到日本的产品，其中国成分可计入 RCEP 原产判定；而在只签双边协定的场景里，同样的中国成分可能被当作非原产、把区域价值成分拉到门槛以下。因此<strong>择优不是选税率，而是选&quot;对这批物料最友好的原产定义&quot;</strong>：工程上要对每批物料分别在各协定的累积假设下重算 PSR，再把仍成立的路径交给净收益比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申报时点-事前裁定与事后救济\">申报时点、事前裁定与事后救济</h2><p>制度择优不是一次性计算，而是跨时间的三段式：<strong>事前</strong>用约束性裁定锁定确定性，<strong>事中</strong>用正确的证明工具主张，<strong>事后</strong>用退税与补证兜底。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>事前——约束性原产地信息（BOI）</strong>：欧盟《联盟海关法典》（UCC, Regulation (EU) No 952/2013）第 33 条允许申请 BOI，有效期 <strong>3 年</strong>，对海关具有约束力；归类问题对应 BTI，同样是 3 年。两者常配套使用，因为税率同时依赖归类与原产地。</li>\n<li><strong>事中——证明工具的选择</strong>：REX 系统下由出口商注册并自行出具&quot;原产地声明&quot;，通常自出具起 <strong>12 个月</strong>内有效；PEM 体系还提供 <strong>长期供应商声明</strong>，一次声明可覆盖最长 12 个月的多次发货——这是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 摊薄、改变盈亏平衡结论的关键工具。</li>\n<li><strong>事后——退税与追溯出具</strong>：UCC 第 121 条的退税权在关税债务通知后 3 年内有效，原产地声明也可在符合条件时追溯出具，使漏填优惠的申报有补救余地。前提是系统保留<strong>完整的计算快照与证据链</strong>，否则再宽的窗口也换不回退税款。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>正确理解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;多个协定可以叠加享受&quot;</td>\n<td>一行货通常只能主张一个优惠，叠加的是资格而非待遇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;税率最低的一定选它&quot;</td>\n<td>需扣掉合规成本与放弃的退税收益，净收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;满足一个协定的 PSR 就到处能用&quot;</td>\n<td>PSR、累积范围、直运规则逐协定不同，资格不可移植</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;优惠一定是好事，漏用就是损失&quot;</td>\n<td>部分未主张是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_r \\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的理性选择，须区分遗漏与择优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;GSP 名单固定不变&quot;</td>\n<td>受益国随收入组动态调整，越南已于 2023 年 1 月毕业</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>先资格、后税率、再成本</strong> —— 顺序是筛选候选制度、计算净收益、落到申报时点，而非直接比较表定税率。</li>\n<li><strong>一行一主张</strong> —— 报关单上的优惠入口互斥，多协定叠加的是&quot;可选项集合&quot;而非&quot;可叠加的待遇&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>净收益才是目标函数</strong> —— 税率差要扣掉原产地合规成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与被放弃的退税收益，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_r \\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时按 MFN 申报是正确答案。</li>\n<li><strong>冲突按累积范围与退税口径裁决</strong> —— 累积规则决定&quot;谁的物料算原产&quot;，退税禁止决定&quot;优惠与退税能否兼得&quot;，二者最常被漏算。</li>\n<li><strong>三段式兜底</strong> —— 事前 BOI/BTI（3 年）、事中 REX 与长期供应商声明（12 个月）、事后 UCC 第 121 条退税（3 年），配合证据链留档才能兑现成现金流。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协定择优决策与最优税率申报路径——多协定择一、叠加与冲突","id":"协定择优决策与最优税率申报路径-多协定择一-叠加与冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：叠加的制度与互斥的申报入口","id":"核心概念-叠加的制度与互斥的申报入口"},{"level":2,"text":"制度坐标：各优惠制度的资格门槛与累积范围","id":"制度坐标-各优惠制度的资格门槛与累积范围"},{"level":2,"text":"择优的计算模型：把税率差折算成可比的到手成本","id":"择优的计算模型-把税率差折算成可比的到手成本"},{"level":2,"text":"择优决策算法与申报路径","id":"择优决策算法与申报路径"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突与叠加：当两条规则指向同一批货","id":"冲突与叠加-当两条规则指向同一批货"},{"level":2,"text":"申报时点、事前裁定与事后救济","id":"申报时点-事前裁定与事后救济"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协定税率表建模与关税计算引擎（MFN vs 优惠、从价/从量/复合税）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/preference-regime-comparison-duty-model/agreement-tariff-schedule-duty-calculation"},"next":{"title":"原产地规则判定模型：完全获得、税则归类改变与最小操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preference-utilization-duty-savings-engineering/sku-origin-qualification-engine/origin-rule-qualification-model"}}